{
    "title": "Archery Bastions: Castle War",
    "description": "Archery Bastions: Castle War is an archery game! Grab your bow and arrows and attack!\r\n\r\nAt your disposal is a tower with stickman archers, with the help of which you must capture the enemy's castle. Aim with your bow and try not to miss!\r\n\r\nThe battle begins castle to castle! You must destroy all enemy archers and destroy their towers. The enemy troops can be larger than yours, the towers are stronger, and the arrows are more destructive!\r\nYou must use every shot wisely, and only then can you win!\r\n\r\nCapturing all the kingdoms will not be easy. You have to fight against orcs, people, monsters and mages! And also fight off the moving horde, enemies on ships and longships! Upgrade archers, get mercenaries, and use different types of arrows, and victory is yours!\r\n\r\nArchery Bastions: Castle War Features:\r\n\r\n- Unique mechanics\r\n- Beautiful graphics\r\n- Easy control\r\n- Different types of arrows\r\n- Various factions\r\n- Original types of battles\r\n- Lots of levels\r\n\r\nArchery Bastions: Castle War is an arrow game where only one can take over all the kingdoms! Become a master of the bow and arrows and defeat the enemy army!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Archery Bastions: Castle War is an archery game! Grab your bow and arrows and attack!<br><br>At your disposal is a tower with stickman archers, with the help of which you must capture the enemy&#39;s castle. Aim with your bow and try not to miss!<br><br>The battle begins castle to castle! You must destroy all enemy archers and destroy their towers. The enemy troops can be larger than yours, the towers are stronger, and the arrows are more destructive!<br>You must use every shot wisely, and only then can you win!<br><br>Capturing all the kingdoms will not be easy. You have to fight against orcs, people, monsters and mages! And also fight off the moving horde, enemies on ships and longships! Upgrade archers, get mercenaries, and use different types of arrows, and victory is yours!<br><br>Archery Bastions: Castle War Features:<br><br>- Unique mechanics<br>- Beautiful graphics<br>- Easy control<br>- Different types of arrows<br>- Various factions<br>- Original types of battles<br>- Lots of levels<br><br>Archery Bastions: Castle War is an arrow game where only one can take over all the kingdoms! Become a master of the bow and arrows and defeat the enemy army!",
